@startuml
title M-01: how a clamped transfer turns into a lost claim
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FDEEEE
  BorderColor #B54A4A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FDEEEE
  DiamondBorderColor #B54A4A
}

start
:Admin calls emergencyWithdrawBIO()
BIO balance of the sale becomes 0;
:User calls claim();
:hasClaimed = true;
:(bioAmount, vbioAmount) = getExpectedClaimAmount(user);
:_safeClaimTransfer(BIO, user, bioAmount);
if (amount > balance ?) then (yes)
  :transfer(user, balance) = transfer(user, 0);<<#FDEEEE>>
else (no)
  :transfer(user, amount);
endif
:_safeClaimTransfer(BIO, vBIO, vbioAmount)
sends 0 to the vesting contract;<<#FDEEEE>>
:vBIO.createVestingSchedule(user, ..., vbioAmount);
note right #FDEEEE
  schedule recorded for the full amount,
  vesting contract received nothing
end note
:claim() succeeds, emits Claim(user, bioAmount, vbioAmount);
:User received 0 BIO and cannot claim again;<<#FDEEEE>>
stop
@enduml
